// ============================================================= songwriting
// Pooled over every style (no source above the single-source cap): a melodic
// phrase's length in beats and its note and distinct-pitch counts (p10, median,
// p90), how often a lane's figure repeats (1, 2 or 4 bars), and how often a
// phrase changes on bar 8 against bars 2-7.
